        <title>Go的学习体验与语言选择</title>
        <link>https://anarchycuriosity.github.io/p/2026-10-20-go%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9/</link>
